   "text": "Embedder       llama.cpp (any GGUF) \u00b7 OpenAI-compatible endpoint\nJudge          Jev (TypeSafe API) \u00b7 llama.cpp reranker (fallback)\nLlm            Anthropic \u00b7 OpenAI-compatible (Ollama, mlx, llama.cpp)\nAgentAdapter   Claude Code \u00b7 Codex \u00b7 pi\nClock          system \u00b7 settable fake",
   "originalText": "Embedder       llama.cpp (any GGUF) \u00b7 OpenAI-compatible endpoint\nJudge          Jev (TypeSafe API) \u00b7 llama.cpp reranker (fallback)\nLlm            Anthropic \u00b7 OpenAI-compatible (Ollama, mlx, llama.cpp)\nAgentAdapter   Claude Code \u00b7 Codex \u00b7 pi\nClock          system \u00b7 settable fake",
